{"lines":[{"id":"s1","text":"Don't tap first.|Check the balance."},{"id":"s2","text":"All froze.|Wrong move."},{"id":"s3","text":"Charge first.|That's the fix."},{"id":"s4","text":"Same card.|Cash in first."},{"id":"s5","text":"Balance back.|Tap it flat."},{"id":"s6","text":"She pointed—"},{"id":"s7","text":"The line moves on.|We just wait."},{"id":"s8","text":"Green light.|Gate opens."},{"id":"s9","text":"Charge first.|Tap second."},{"id":"n1","text":"Charge first.|Before the gate."},{"id":"n2","text":"An empty card|slams it shut."},{"id":"n3","text":"Tap it flat.|Walk through."},{"id":"n4","text":"That's Japan first times.|Follow for more."}],"rate":"+8%","voice":"en-US-GuyNeural"}